From: Weightmans LLP <litigation@weightmans.example> (Solicitors for Citrosuco)
To: RBS Resolve Business Solutions <legal@rbs-resolve.example>
Date: 2020-07-30
Subject: KSY Juice Blends / Citrosuco - your email of 13 July 2020

Our client denies any sums are (or were ever) due to KSY under said invoices or at all... The correct position is that Citrosuco's contractual commitment was/is limited to purchasing (and KSY's commitment to supplying) 400 mt of product each year for the agreed price of EUR 1350 (discounted from EUR 1600), with agreement to purchase an additional 800mt each year subject to agreement on price by the end of the December preceding each contract year. In other words, in the absence of agreement on price, KSY has no obligation to supply, and Citrosuco no obligation to purchase the additional 800 mt.

--
RECONSTRUCTED FROM THE PUBLISHED JUDGMENT. Not an original document.
Source: KSY Juice Blends v Citrosuco [2024] EWHC 2098 (Comm), paras 3, 141, Appendix 2 (entry 30.7.20).
Letter shown as an email; addresses and subject line are placeholders; body as quoted. Citrosuco separately admits EUR 64,287.72 on the two 2020 items (para 3).
